{"slug":"578599-sihi-sihi-sebu","title":"ಸಿಹಿ ಸಿಹಿ ಸೇಬು","titleEn":"Sihi Sihi Sebu","level":"1","description":"","orientation":"landscape","cover":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/578599-sihi-sihi-sebu/cover.jpg","width":548,"height":548},"audio":null,"provenance":{"source":"https://storyweaver.org.in/en/stories/578599-sihi-sihi-sebu","license":"CC-BY-4.0","licenseNote":"Fetched from StoryWeaver's public API; the book's own attribution page states 'Released under CC BY 4.0 license' for the story and each illustration. Text is the page HTML with markup removed; illustrations are StoryWeaver's 700–960 px crops, unmodified apart from JPEG re-encoding; audio re-encoded to mono MP3.","storyweaverId":578599,"authors":["Kedar  Shrestha"],"illustrators":["Binita  Buddhacharya"],"translators":["Sarita Sharan"],"publisher":"Pratham Books","publishedYear":"2023","originalStory":{"title":"गुलियो स्याउ"},"copyrightNotice":"‘Sihi Sihi Sebu’ has been published on StoryWeaver by Pratham Books. www.prathambooks.org.","attributionLine":"ಸಿಹಿ ಸಿಹಿ ಸೇಬು (Kannada), translated by Sarita Sharan, based on original story गुलियो स्याउ, written by Kedar  Shrestha, illustrated by Binita  Buddhacharya, published by Pratham Books (© Pratham Books, 2023) under a CC BY 4.0 license on StoryWeaver. Read, create and translate stories for free on www.storyweaver.org.in","imageCredits":[{"page":2,"title":"Girl painting on a notebook","illustrator":"Binita Buddhacharya","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2013"},{"page":3,"title":"Mother and girl conversing","illustrator":"Binita Buddhacharya","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2013"},{"page":4,"title":"Girl painting a leaf","illustrator":"Binita Buddhacharya","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2013"},{"page":5,"title":"Girl lying down and painting","illustrator":"Binita Buddhacharya","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2013"},{"page":6,"title":"Girl shows off her art","illustrator":"Binita Buddhacharya","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2013"},{"page":7,"title":"Girl paints clouds","illustrator":"Binita Buddhacharya","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2013"},{"page":8,"title":"Girl paints a green apple","illustrator":"Binita Buddhacharya","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2013"},{"page":9,"title":"Girl gives her painting to her mother","illustrator":"Binita Buddhacharya","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2013"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/578599-sihi-sihi-sebu/p01.jpg","width":639,"height":687},"text":["ರಜನಿ ಬಣ್ಣ ತುಂಬಲು ಪ್ರಾರಂಭಿಸಿದಳು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/578599-sihi-sihi-sebu/p02.jpg","width":639,"height":687},"text":["“ಸೂರ್ಯನ ಬಣ್ಣ ಹಳದಿ ಅಲ್ಲವೇ, ಮಗು?” ಅಮ್ಮ ಕೇಳಿದರು.","“ಅಮ್ಮೋ, ಇದು ಮುಂಜಾನೆಯ ಸೂರ್ಯ,” ರಜನಿಯ ಉತ್ತರ."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/578599-sihi-sihi-sebu/p03.jpg","width":479,"height":686},"text":["ರಜನಿ ಎಲೆಗೆ ಕಂದು ಬಣ್ಣ ತುಂಬಿದಳು.","“ಎಲೆಯ ಬಣ್ಣ ಹಸಿರಾಗಿರಬೇಕು. ಅಲ್ಲವೇ ಮಗು?” ಅಮ್ಮ ಕೇಳಿದರು."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/578599-sihi-sihi-sebu/p04.jpg","width":479,"height":686},"text":["“ಆದರೆ, ಇದು ಒಣ ಎಲೆ, ಅಮ್ಮಾ.”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/578599-sihi-sihi-sebu/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["“ನೋಡಮ್ಮಾ ಇಲ್ಲಿ! ನಾನು ಎಷ್ಟು ಸುಂದರವಾದ ಹೂವು ಚಿತ್ರಿಸಿದ್ದೇನೆ.","“ನಮ್ಮ ಮನೆಯ ಹೂವುಗಳ ಬಣ್ಣ ಕೆಂಪು, ಮಗಳೇ,” ಎಂದರು ಅಮ್ಮ.","“ಆದರೆ, ನಮ್ಮ ಶಾಲೆಯ ಹೂವುಗಳ ಬಣ್ಣ ಹಳದೀಯಮ್ಮಾ.”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/578599-sihi-sihi-sebu/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ರಜನಿ ಆಕಾಶಕ್ಕೆ ಬೂದು ಬಣ್ಣ ತುಂಬಿದಳು.","“ಆಕಾಶದ ಬಣ್ಣ ನೀಲಿ ಆಗಿರಬೇಕಲ್ಲವೇ, ಮಗು?” ಅಮ್ಮ ಕೇಳಿದರು.","“ರಾತ್ರಿ ಆಕಾಶದಲ್ಲಿ ಕತ್ತಲೆಯಾಗಿರುತ್ತದೆ ಅಮ್ಮಾ.”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/578599-sihi-sihi-sebu/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ರಜನಿ ಸೇಬಿಗೆ ಬಣ್ಣ ಹಚ್ಚಿದಳು. “ಅದು ಕೆಂಪಾಗಿರಬೇಕಲ್ಲವೇ?” ಕೇಳಿದರು ಅಮ್ಮ.","“ಇದು ಎಳೆಯ ಸೇಬು, ಅಮ್ಮಾ.”","“ಹಸಿರು ಸೇಬುಗಳು ಹುಳಿಯಾಗಿರುತ್ತವೆ, ಕೂಸೇ,” ಎಂದರು ಅಮ್ಮ."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/578599-sihi-sihi-sebu/p08.jpg","width":479,"height":686},"text":["“ಅದಕ್ಕ್ಯಾಕೆ ಚಿಂತಿಸುವೆಯಮ್ಮಾ? ನಿಮಗಾಗಿ ಸಿಹಿ ಸಿಹಿ ಸೇಬು ಇಲ್ಲಿದೆ,” ಎಂದಳು ರಜನಿ."]}],"wordCount":98}